      "text": "2. How can we ensure that redirects are fast? ",
      "fontSize": 32.60078573738094,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. How can we ensure that redirects are fast? ",
